  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WCS/GoT collaborative efforts to improve law enforcement, law enforcement monitoring, and human-elephant conflict mitigation in Kaeng Krachan National Park</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to: 1) Improve protection for elephants and elephant habitat in KKNP and to continue law enforcement monitoring (LEM) work using SMART to help enhance effectiveness of protection work; 2) Reduce humanelephant conflict by promoting standard mitigation methods as well as monitoring the effectiveness of those methods and continuing HEC monitoring to assess the success of the mitigation work; 3) Expand elephant conservation education in the area and to promote the HEC mitigation scheme in order to improve cooperation among park staff, local communities and other stakeholders.</narrative>
  </description>
